@page "/Account/Lockout"

<PageTitle>@L["Account locked"]</PageTitle>

<header>
    <h1 class="text-danger">@L["Account locked"]</h1>
    <p class="text-danger" role="alert">@L["This account was temporarily locked. Try again later."]</p>
</header>
@* Criar uma senha nova pelo link do e-mail desbloqueia a conta na hora (veja AccountRecoveryService) *@
<p>@L["Don't want to wait? Create a new password and your account is unlocked right away."]</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="Account/ForgotPassword">@L["Forgot your password?"]</a></p>
